=== bulk on object layer raises
IMPORT "tiled"
DIM m AS TILED_MAP
m = TILED_LOAD("m.json")
PRINT TILED_FLOOD_FILL(m, 0, 0, 0, 5)
--- datei m.json
{"type": "map", "width": 6, "height": 4, "tilewidth": 16, "tileheight": 16, "tilesets": [{"firstgid": 1, "name": "t", "tilewidth": 16, "tileheight": 16, "columns": 4, "image": "t.png", "imagewidth": 64, "imageheight": 64}], "layers": [{"type": "objectgroup", "name": "obj", "objects": []}]}
--- fehler
TILED_FLOOD_FILL: Layer 0 ('obj') ist kein Tile-Layer

